{{wikipedia|ollie (skateboarding)|Ollie}}

===Etymology===
From “Ollie”, the nickname of the Florida skateboarder [[w:Alan Gelfand|Alan Gelfand]].

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|skateboarding|snowboarding}} aerial maneuver wherein one [[catch air|catches air]] by jumping off the ground and into the air and not changing the angle of the forward momentum; a [[hop]].

===Verb===
{{en-verb|ollies|ollying|pres_ptc2=ollieing|ollied}}

# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To perform an ollie.

